{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42223","headline":"赠泰州掾令狐克己 · 徐铉","name":"赠泰州掾令狐克己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"念子才多命且奇，乱中抛掷少年时。\n深藏七泽衣如雪，却见中朝鬓似丝。\n旧德在人终远大，扁舟爲吏莫推辞。\n孤芳自爱凌霜处，咏取文公白菊诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}